DungGeunMo + Fixedsys 1.3

Authors: Jungtae Kim (Dunggeunmo-kkol), Darien Gavin Valentine
(Fixedsys Excelsior), Kil Hyung-jin / CACTUS (combined and improved font).

The publisher explicitly releases the font as public domain, including
permission to redistribute, modify and use it commercially.
Source: https://cactus.tistory.com/193 ("사용권" section).
Publisher's permission statement:
원본과 동일한 퍼블릭 도메인으로 재배포, 수정, 영리 목적 사용 등 걱정 없이 자유롭게 쓰면 됩니다.

DomeD converts the original to a 16px monochrome BDF. The conversion script
and pinned source hashes are retained beside the generated font.
